        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomár waawutmo Daudi iwa baraá doó waawuti'iimár hooti, qoomaadae AAKOÓ MUNGÚ guri tsuúq iwa waydúr hooti nee wakuuserós umuúqo barto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waawutmo Daudi iri oó' dír Natani, kuduú aarusmo, «Áx qayteek, aníng dír ni hoot a baraá doó taa tleéhh ar xaa'aá sahhta, ala sandakmoó Mungú dír i hooti a baraá heéma.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Natani waawutmo guri báy, «Gimáy adoosíng taa insleér baraá muunaáwoge tleehheek, asma AAKOÓ MUNGÚ a dinkwa nee kuúng.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala xweeraadaá kilae Natani axweesantá AAKOÓ MUNGÚ gari axaás i kat, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Tláw, sagadiyusmooeé' Daudi kaangwí baweek, AAKOÓ MUNGÚ i kaahi, ‹Xáy kuúng doó aníng ni hoot uqo tléhha? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimír múk Israeli nguwa baraá yaamaá Misrír wa tuú/ ay laarí aga baraá dó'wa hootiiká. Ana hi'iimiít, umuú diiro hotangw'eé' a baraá heémár Mungú. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Xáy, umuú dír naqo kawi nee múk Israeli sleémeero, heé naa gaa báw i deéro baraá har'ohuusér múk Israeliwo, kudá' naa bawi, muk'eé' oo Israeli de'eemaak, niwa kah, waáy misa doó xa'aá sahhtaárí tlehhi'iiká?›",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Gawaá adoorihe sagadiyusmooeé' Daudi baweek, AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Aleesleemusmo i kaahi, ‹Una leéhh baraá qawtantá bee/aangw tawa de'een, as uwa uráy haniis daanduú muk'eé' oo Israeliwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimír qoomaadae aníng nee kuúng a dinkwa, amór taqo keera nee wakuuseerók ana geeraawógi hhaamiís, án kuúng u iia tleereés adór múk hatlá' oo urén baraá yaamuwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng dír muk'eé' iwa hooti an tsawaár, inooín ngiri didií dahaás, as tawa didá' wa hooti inooín kilooín, mikiwa daawitamiís male ale, as kahhó' múk tlákw oo /uureemooínár slaáqw, mingiwa male slahh'eemiís adoodár bál geeraá wa ale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimír bál mukduú har'ohuuse nguwa tsawaár tawa daanduú muk'eé' oo Israeli, aníng kuúng u xuúm dír wakuserók sleémeeroe. Ar tí sleémeero ga baa/ a tí, AAKOÓ MUNGÚ kuúng un babay, aníng kuúng u dó' i tleéhh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Deeloorók ar tawa kahhut bira xeér tari haragwá' amór baabi'iiwók kudá' naa qatliye'. Daqaní na/aywók oo kilá' un waawutmoó wa qaás, aníng waawuti'iimarós ngari gawdeés. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na/aywí an kudá' do' gu tleéhh as umuueé', nee kitaangós kuduú aleesleemu oo waawuti'iimarós un gawdeés ay kureerisleém. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng tari baabuúwós, inós tari garmaaeé'. Tlaákw birnga tleéhh, un iigahhaát, adoodár muu i /imamisi na/ii'ín kiwa naanaqaqati ar hhara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala sla'aarir'eé' ar warqawaaká a hingeesaaká dirose, adór ngira hingeés dír Saulowo, kudá' naa hiingeés geeraawók wá ale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Do'ók nee waawuti'iimaroge i kumaamitiyá' dír geeraaeé' waá ale daqiisleém. Kitaangók oo waawuti'iima ku gawdees kureerisleém.› »",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Natani umuú gaaro gana alki/iít dír Daudi, tidá' Mungú aa dirósí laqán ar baraá iigu'utu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy waawutmo Daudi iri tláy, iri iwiít geeraá AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, iri firín, iri oó', «Aníng a heemá, xáy Aakoó MUNGÚ, nee múk dooeé' a gár milá tam ay diirí án niwa iia tleerúw laarí. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aá Aakoó MUNGÚ! Slám gár adór tí a gár niina dír ilawoge, Aakoó MUNGÚ. Gár tí ga baa/ a al'axweesantidár muruú urén, ar taa ó' dír múk dooeé', ar kureeraá yaariir awa hi'iitá', nee adór muruú qari sleémeero ar aluú wá hi'iit ngura aníngí xu'utís. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aá Aakoó MUNGÚ, anuú Daudi lawaalmoowók, gár ni male dirógií oo' a milá? Asma kuúng anuúwí oo lawaalmoowók i xú'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As al'axweesantoge nee as sla'aarír muunaáwoge, muruú urén ugwa tléhh sleémeero as iwa xu'utís, anuú lawaalmoowók. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baraá muruudá' sleémeero taa axamamisani, kuúng Aakoó MUNGÚ tu úr, oo adór kuúng i kaahh, nee Munguú hatlá' i kaahh aqo har kuúng. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Slám baraá yaamuwo muu a gaalá oo ta slaqasi nee mukók oo Israeli? Kudá' Munguúín aa ba/amisár áy as tawa mukós. Muruú urén oo waa/oo/amo guri tleéhh baraá yaamuuwose dír geeraá mukose, umuuwós iri xu'utiít. Giri ba/amisár áy baraá Misri as inós, xoordu giri geeraaín wa guús nee mungui'ine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuúng mukók oo Israeli ugwa kángw kilá' wa gawdés as tawa mukók kureerisleém, kuúng AAKOÓ MUNGÚ an Munguín.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Aá AAKOÓ MUNGÚ gimáy, hamí al'axweesantók boo/eseek adoodá' kara ó' dír anuú lawaalmoowók, nee adoodá' kara ó' dír xwaylar'eé'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muu umuuwók ngu xirfayeemisi daqisleém, tawa kaahi, ‹AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Aleesleemusmo a Mungú daanduú múk Israeliwo.› Nee xwaylár lawaalmoowók Daudi ka gawdees dír geeraawoge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
